Figure 1: Diagnostic accuracy of ten general-purpose LLMs under three evidence-access settings
(798 model–case pairs).
Fullsight receives the complete case upfront;
Foresight prospectively acquires evidence over at least six turns;
and Hindsight retrospectively selects and orders diagnostically critical evidence
from the completed case without reference diagnosis, before re-diagnosis.

